<title>COLOMBIA: Colombia's Bancoquia Q1 net down 3 pct.</title>
<headline>Colombia's Bancoquia Q1 net down 3 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BOGOTA 1997-05-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Colombia's Bancoquia bank posted the following first-quarter results, the banking superintendency said Wednesday:</p>
<p>Net profits Q1 1997 5.5 billion pesos vs 5.7 billion in Q1 1996.</p>
<p>Total assets Q1 1997 1.58 trillion pesos vs 1.31 trillion pesos.</p>
<p>The results were announced on the day that Spain's Banco Santander formerly agreed to purchase a 55 percent stake in the bank, the financial arm of the Julio Santodomingo industrial conglomerate, for $146 million.</p>
<p>((--Javier Mozzo, Bogota newsroom, 571 610 7944))</p>
